{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q426010","formula":"C₁₉H₂₇N₃O₄","hill":"C19H27N3O4","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":19.0,"H":27.0,"N":3.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"Semagacestat","ru":"Семагацестат"},"descriptions":{"en":"Semagacestat (LY-450139) was a candidate drug for a causal therapy against Alzheimer's disease. It was originally developed by Eli Lilly and Elan, and clinical trials were conducted by Eli Lilly. Phase III trials included over 3000 patients, but in August 2010, a disappointing interim analysis, in which semagacestat performed worse than the placebo, led to the trials being stopped.","ru":"Семагацестат (LY450139) — ингибитор гамма-секретазы, потенциальное лекарство от болезни Альцгеймера, не прошедшее клинические испытания. Оно разрабатывалось компаниями Eli Lilly and Company и Élan. Однако клинические испытания, третья фаза которых проводилась компанией Eli Lilly с участием более чем 3000 пациентов в 31 стране мира, были прекращены в августе 2010 года."},"fame":6,"pubchemCid":9843750,"mass":361.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@@H](C(=O)N[C@H]1C2=CC=CC=C2CCN(C1=O)C)NC(=O)[C@H](C(C)C)O","inchikey":"PKXWXXPNHIWQHW-RCBQFDQVSA-N","iupac":"(2S)-2-hydroxy-3-methyl-N-[(2S)-1-[[(5S)-3-methyl-4-oxo-2,5-dihydro-1H-3-benzazepin-5-yl]amino]-1-oxopropan-2-yl]butanamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"9843750","atoms":53,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-2.917,"y":-2.111,"z":-1.345,"el":"O"},{"x":5.328,"y":0.96,"z":-1.181,"el":"O"},{"x":0.743,"y":-0.803,"z":1.47,"el":"O"},{"x":2.888,"y":0.086,"z":-1.787,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.208,"y":-1.261,"z":0.381,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.661,"y":-1.27,"z":-0.317,"el":"N"},{"x":2.886,"y":-1.512,"z":-0.101,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.838,"y":-0.615,"z":0.213,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.941,"y":0.869,"z":-0.099,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.307,"y":1.